<title>HONG KONG: Seaunion says exec director Choi resigns.</title>
<headline>Seaunion says exec director Choi resigns.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seaunion Holdings Ltd said in a statement on Friday Choi Sai Leung had resigned as an executive director of the company with effect from August 29.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
